# Ownership of every file this notebook ships. Read by scripts/doc_research/update.sh
# and by check.py. See UPDATING.md.
#
#   template  replaced outright on update. Never edit these.
#   merge     three-way merged against the version originally installed.
#   seed      written once at install, never touched again.
#
# Anything not listed here — labbook/entries/, calculations/, figures/, log/weekly/,
# and all of Erin's own code — is invisible to the updater and cannot be modified
# by it.
#
# Patterns are shell globs in which `*` also matches `/`, so `scripts/x/*` covers
# nested paths. The LAST matching line wins.

template  CLAUDE.md
template  AGENTS.md
template  UPDATING.md
template  labbook/preamble.tex
template  labbook/00_rules.tex
template  labbook/README.md
template  log/README.md
template  calculations/README.md
template  calculations/_template/*
template  figures/README.md
template  figures/_template.md
template  scripts/doc_research/*
template  .claude/commands/*

merge     pixi.toml
merge     .claude/settings.json

seed      NOTEBOOK.md
seed      TASTE.md
seed      FEEDBACK.md
seed      ONBOARDING.md
seed      INDEX.md
seed      labbook.tex
seed      worklog.tex
seed      labbook/entries.tex
seed      log/weeks.tex
